      "content": "being present with it just makes it feel heavier. it's hard to be \"aware\" of how much everything hurts. i can't even walk to the mailbox without getting winded now. it feels like my body has already given up on me, so i'm just stuck in this shell that isn't mine anymore. it's like i'm just waiting for a permission slip to finally rest.",
